<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f3f4f6;">
  <tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" dir="ltr" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;">
      <tr><td style="height:4px;line-height:4px;font-size:0;background-color:#0f766e;" bgcolor="#0f766e">&nbsp;</td></tr>
      <tr><td align="left" style="padding:24px 32px 8px;"><img src="https://cdn.example.com/logo.png" alt="WM Health Istanbul" height="40" style="display:block;height:40px;width:auto;max-width:220px;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;" /></td></tr>
      <tr><td dir="ltr" align="left" style="padding:16px 32px 24px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1f2937;text-align:left;"><p>Hello Ayşe Yılmaz,</p><p>Thank you for your consultation with Op. Dr. M. Demir. Sharing your experience helps other patients.</p><p>This link can be used once and is valid for 30 days.</p><p>Please do not include a diagnosis, medication or details that identify anyone. Your review is checked before it is published.</p><p style="font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;"><a href="http://localhost:3000/en/review/sample-token?optout=1" style="color:#6b7280;">If you do not want to receive review requests again, click here</a></p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0;"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#0f766e" style="padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;background-color:#0f766e;"><a href="http://localhost:3000/en/review/sample-token" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;line-height:20px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;">Share your experience</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>
